              "jcr:created": "Thu Jun 05 2025 19:35:30 GMT+0000",
              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "line1": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5-vw\">Craniomaxillofacial</span></span></span></h1>\r\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">Our commitment to education &amp; training:<br />\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">At Stryker, we never forget that everything we hope to do for patients depends on the skills and experience of the medical professionals who use our products. Our goal is your success. From post-graduate to practice, we offer courses for you every step of the way.</span></p>\r\n",
